    "synopsis": {
        "native": "\u00cencerc\u00e2nd s\u0103 \u00een\u021beleag\u0103 dedesubturile fenomenului graffiti \u0219i street art din Rom\u00e2nia, un corporatist ajunge s\u0103 se descopere pe sine. Pornit ca o analiz\u0103 obiectiv\u0103 a unei contraculturi, documentarul se transform\u0103 \u00eentr-o poveste intim\u0103 de maturizare a unui b\u0103rbat de 35 de ani, \u00eenghi\u021bit de universul diferit pe care \u00eel descoper\u0103. Filmul exploreaz\u0103 toate dimensiunile \u0219i specificit\u0103\u021bile aceste comunit\u0103\u021bi - de la interven\u021biile pe metrouri, tramvaie, trenuri, ajung\u00e2nd la ac\u021biuni clandestine pe str\u0103zi, \u00een spa\u021biul public sau \u00een locuri abandonate.",
        "english": "While trying to understand the underbelly of the graffiti and street art phenomenon in Romania, a young corporate employee discovers his true self. This is the first documentary about the Romanian graffiti and street art movement."
